  - L_0 = (11, 8, 14): involution=True, symmetric=False, orthogonal=False, canceling_masks=0
  - L_1 = (10, 9, 11): involution=True, symmetric=False, orthogonal=False, canceling_masks=0
  - L_2 = (9, 4, 14): involution=True, symmetric=False, orthogonal=False, canceling_masks=0
  - L_3 = (8, 9, 7): involution=True, symmetric=True , orthogonal=True , canceling_masks=255
  - Verified 8 disjoint 4-column islands of L_3: [0, 8, 23, 31] .. [7, 15, 22, 30]
  - S-box ANF: pi_w = w ^ wy ^ xy ^ xz ^ wyz; pi_x = x ^ wy; pi_y = y ^ wy ^ wxy ^ wz; pi_z = wy ^ xy ^ z
  - Super-S-box collapse (row x): pi_x ^ pi_w*pi_y = x ^ wy ^ xy ^ wz ^ wxz ^ xyz (deg = 3)
  - Super-S-box collapse (row z): pi_z ^ (pi_x^pi_w)*pi_y = wy ^ xy ^ wxy ^ z ^ wz ^ wyz ^ xyz (deg = 3)

[3/4] Audit of Bellini et al. (LATINCRYPT 2025, ePrint 2025/1443 Section 6.2)
