  - Mitigation L_3' = (7, 3, 11): involution=True, XORs/bit=2, canceling_masks=0, 48-CP annihilators=[24, 24, 24, 24] (total=96 < 128 -> attack neutralized)
  - Mitigation L_3'' = (3, 1, 5): involution=True, XORs/bit=2, canceling_masks=0, 48-CP annihilators=[24, 24, 24, 24] (total=96 < 128 -> attack neutralized)

